title type='text'>Will,In part one you seemed to say that using the ...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In part one you seemed to say that using the military to cajole civilians was not that big a step since the police have been multiplied and militarized. Here you seem to be coming around.  It IS significant simply because of the numbers and quality of the forces available.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In other words, the elites KNOW they are begging for a revolution, and they are about to drive so many people over the edge that the police alone don&#39;t have the manpower to tamp down on the entire populace.  They need to bring the military in to turn on the population.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;and to Will BLALOCK, you are quite correct that it is coming down to &quot;us and them&quot; rather than &quot;left/right&quot;.  There is an A/V file at &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://christianconstitutionalsociety.org/phpBB2/viewtopic.php?t=36&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;this location &lt;/A&gt; called &quot;Beyond Left and Right&quot; that puts it all together.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2986764306849693881/comments/default/955265336828086816'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2986764306849693881/comments/default/955265336828086816'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/09/rubicon-in-rear-view-part-ii-perpetual.html?showComment=1222714200000#c955265336828086816' title=''/><author><name>Mark Moore (Moderator)</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17386056132530808723</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/09/rubicon-in-rear-view